## L05 — FinalCAD/FINALCAD-CleanAndFix

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Source | https://github.com/FinalCAD/FINALCAD-CleanAndFix |
| License | MIT |
| Install | NETLOAD the released DLL, or merge into our `autocad-plugin/` |

Open-source AutoCAD .NET plugin with the same architecture as ours:

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `FCCLEAN` | reconciles + unlocks layers, erases proxies |
| `FCDYNTOSTATIC` | converts dynamic blocks to static |
| `FCBLACK` / `FCDARKER` / `FCGRAYSCALE` | colour-mass changes |
| layer filter helpers | quickly hide/show per filter |

We can either reference its commands directly, or port the relevant
ones into `autocad-plugin/CommandProcessor.cs` (license-compatible).

