## L06 — beastt1992/WallCenterline

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Source | https://github.com/beastt1992/WallCenterline |
| License | check upstream |
| Use | analyse 3rd-party DWGs that lack centerlines |

When a client sends a DWG with only solid-hatched walls (no centerline
geometry), this routine derives a centerline polyline by skeletonising
the wall hatch. We need it before any of our `bina-b-type`-style
generators can re-use the geometry.

